# Used by `npm run build`. Set this to the deployed backend, and it MUST start with wss:// (an https page blocks ws://).
# Example: VITE_WS_URL=wss://tactica-backend.example.com/api/stream
# While empty, the deployed app runs on the built-in fixture match instead of a dead connection.
# Everything in a VITE_ variable is public in the browser. Never put an API key here.
VITE_WS_URL=